### Component 2: Exotel Outbound Client

#### [NEW] [exotel_client.py](file:///c:/NovaAutomata_Internship/VoiceAgent_Pipecat/app/services/exotel_client.py)

A focused, typed Exotel REST API client for triggering outbound calls.

**Class: `ExotelOutboundClient`**

```python
